udes notifications.\n\n🌱 FARMING TAB\n⚔️ Auto Swing\n\nAutomatically swings katana to gain ninjitsu.\n\n💰 Auto Sell\n\nAuto-detects max ninjitsu and sells it by touching sell circle.\n\n💠 Auto Chi\n\nTeleports to Blue Chi Crates and collects them.\n\n🛡 Auto Rank\n\nAutomatically buys all available ranks.\n\n⚔️ Auto Purchase Swords\n\nBuys all swords on the selected island.\n\n🎒 Auto Purchase Belts\n\nBuys all belts on the selected island.\n\n🌀 Auto Upgrade Skills\n\nBuys all skills on the selected island.\n\n🥷 Auto Purchase Shurikens\n\nBuys all shurikens on the selected island.\n\n🏝 Purchase From Island (Dropdown)\n\nSelect which island store to use for auto-buy features.\n\n🔄 Farm Hoops\n\nCollects all hoops for coins.\n\nIncludes Hoop Delay slider to set time between each hoop.\n\n🧬 Pet Dupe\n\nFires acceptTrade event repeatedly to dupe when hatching.\n\n🥚 HATCHING TAB\n🥚 Select Egg (Dropdown)\n\nChoose which crystal to open.\n\n🧨 Open Eggs\n\nAutomatically opens the selected egg.\n\n💸 Auto Sell Pet Rarities:\n\nSell Basic\n\nSell Advanced\n\nSell Rare\n\nSell Epic\n\nSell Unique\n\nSell Omega\n\n🔄 Auto Evolve\n\nAutomatically evolve pets.\n\n🔥 Auto Eternalise\n\nConverts to Eternal pets.\n\n🌌 Auto Immortalize\n\nConverts to Immortal pets.\n\n⭐ Auto Legend\n\nConverts to Legendary pets.","tags":["script","NinjaLegends","ninja","legend"],"discord":"https://discord.gg/pSSgQzvs","keyLink":"","owner":{"_id":"6614af53b4fdb74099366f7d","username":"Ketamine_Roblox","verified":false,"profilePicture":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6c9b90bd66493c45ccc7855113b2f706929ad7c95a813564f8c330c91f087ce2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6614af53b4fdb74099366f7d-1777778961408.png"},"status":"offline","id":"6614af53b4fdb74099366f7d","profile":{"url":"https://media.kocakz.me/6c9b90bd66493c45ccc7855113b2f706929ad7c95a813564f8c330c91f087ce2.webp","original":"https://scriptblox.com/images/photo/6614af53b4fdb74099366f7d-1777778961408.png"}},"reviewed":null,"liked":fa